  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Anonymized sample prescriptions for testing Gemma 4 vision extraction and the missing-dosage-days edge case. Images live in public/samples/. 'medications' is the offline fallback used when no Gemma provider is reachable, so the demo still works end to end. Add a new sample by dropping an SVG/photo in public/samples/ and appending an entry — see CONTRIBUTING.md.",
